    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d682">

                <pb facs="1070" n="974" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg974"/>

                <head>No. 680.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish
                        to General Sickles.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-12-17"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 17,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your tender of resignation was only hypothetical, and your telegram referred it
                    to alleged publications, unknown here, attributing dissatisfaction which had not
                    been expressed.</p>
                <p>Under these circumstances publication is not deemed necessary, and cannot be
                    authorized.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
